<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Ngalata</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka Ngalata</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ngalata</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nga</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">NGALATA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda ua Ngalata vausonekele kuli kanganda Paulu (1:1) Ou ukeuo mukanda uje Paulu uasonekelele vikungulukilo viaku Ngalata ha miaka makumi auana na miaka itanu na itatu na mukati ka miaka makumi atanu na miaka itanu na ivali (48-57) hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu. Vantu vaku Ngalata vakele nakuyoya mu Loma mu mbonge ya Ngalata. Vaka kulilongesa kuvazivuka muacili kuje Paulu uakele omo uakele nakusoneka ou mukanda, vuno honi mu vinganda evi vivali via Efeso na Kolinte hamo mukemo muje mu cihela muakele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulu uasonekele ou mukanda mukuleka vaka Kilistu hamo na Vayunda nakuli vaje keti Vayunda vaje vamu vikungulukilo via mu Ngalata. Uausonekelele cikuma mukutenukila ha vilongesa via makuli vije vihandeka nguavio vaka Kilistu vanapande kukavangeya mashiko a Vayunda kuhuminina mu litavasano lia laja, cikumani ha kulovoka. Kuakele civunga ca vantu hakati ka vaka Kilistu cije civatumbuile nguavo Yundaize cije catondele vaka Kilistu vaje keti Vayunda ngeci valovoke. Kaha naua vakevo vaje vakele na cihula ha vunganda vua Paulu vua nzili yakama. Paulu uemanenene vunganda vuendi mukuhandeka vimo via vimpande viendi (1:11; 2:14) Kaha uemanenene Muzimbu Uacili mukulumbununa nguendi kuovoka casa kukalako lika mukutsiliela muli Yesu Kilistu (2:16) Ovu vukevo vunapu vukaleho vua ngozi ya Njambi ije yakamuesa kaha keti vije vivakalingi vantu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu aputuka mukanda uendi mukumeneka vikungulukilo viamu Ngalata 1:1-5</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ambahoni Paulu alumbununa vimo via vuyoye vuendi, mukuimanena kapandi kendi mu kulongesa na kumuesa ngeci neseka mukuyoya mu lishiko vuno honi lije kuliakele nakupanga 1:6; 2:21</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cakuhatako Paulu atualelelaho kulumbununa cikuma cipangi ca lishiko na kavumbi mukuovoka 3; 4</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ambahoni Paulu ahana vishika lika via vuyoye vua vukua Kilistu vuacili 5; 6:10</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Cakumanusuila, Paulu amanusula mukanda uendi na cihindu na lilombelo liakumanusuila. Mukuvuluka ngeci Njambi namutengulula kupua muntu ua muha, cije cikeco cinapu caseho cikuma kumashiko ahambanza mashiko aje ngue a kulovoka 6:11-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Yange Paulu kanganda uje keti uakuhuma ku vantu cipue kuhitila mu muntu, vuno honi kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu na Njambi Tate, uje uamusanguile ku vatsi, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />yange na vamuanetu voshe vaje vanjili navo, tuli nakumitumina ou mukanda,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:2">Ku vikungulukilo via mu Ngalatiya:<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Kavumbi na ciyulo vikale neni vije vihuma kuli Njambi Tate na Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />uje ualihanene ikeye vavenia ha vipi vietu mukutuhumisa ku vupi ovu vua vuavuno, kuya ku cizango ca Njambi yetu Tatetu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Kuli ikeye kukale vumpau ku miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuli lika Muzimbu Uacili umo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Njalikomokela ngeci yeni voshe muahumu vuasi kuli uje uamisanene mu kavumbi ka Kilistu nakutengulukila ku Muzimbu Uacili ueka. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Keti ngue nguavo kuli muzimbu ueka naua, vuno honi kuli vamo vaje vali nakumitanganesa kaha vatonda kutangula Muzimbu Uacili ua Kilistu. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Vuno honi cipue vene nga yetu indi kangelo uakuhuminina muilu, uje akambulula Muzimbu Uacili ueka uakuliseza na uje utuambuluile yetu kuli yeni, kaha apue uakusinga. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Ngue muje mutunahandeka ha kulivanga, nahano hanga naua njicihandeka nguange, nga kukala umo akambulula kuli yeni Muzimbu Uacili ueka uakuliseza na uje umuatambuile, kaha apue uakusinga.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Nkuma yange njilinakutonda ngeci vantu vanjishangale indi Njambi? Indi nkuma njilinakueseka kuvuahelesa vantu ndi? Nga hanga njicili nakuvuahelesa vantu, ngue kunjapuile nji ngamba ua Kilistu.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muje Paulu uapuile kanganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Muomu njitonda linga muzivuke vamuanetu, ngeci Muzimbu Uacili uje yange njambuluile kuuapuile uakuhuma ku muntu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Muomu kunjautambuile kuli muntu, cipue kulilongesauo, vuno honi uezile kuhitila mukusholola ca Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Muomu munevu vuyoye vuange vualaja mu futisi ya Vayunda, muje vati munjapakesele cikungulukilo ca Njambi muakupihia nakutonda kucinongesa. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Kaha njahianene mu futisi ya Vayunda kupulakana vavengi vaje mutunapuila hamo ku miaka hakati ka vantu vange, nankuma njalihanene cikuma ku vilika via vakukuluila vetu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Vuno honi omo Njambi uje uanjihanguile laja tele kanda njisemuke, nakunjisana kuhitila mu kavumbi kendi, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />uavuahelele cikuma hakusholola Munendi kuli yange linga njikamuambulule viendi hakati ka vaje keti Vayunda, kunjaile kuli muntu umo mukunjinangula, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />cipue kuya ku Yelusalema kuli vaje vapuile tunganda tele kanda yange, vuno honi njaile mu Alambiya kaha naua njahilukile ku Ndamasika. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Ambahoni hanima ya miaka itatu njaile ku Yelusalema mukumenekela Kayafase kaha njakele nendi kuje matangua likumi na atanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Vuno honi kunjakamueneko tunganda veka naua kuvanga lika Yakomba munaina ya Muene.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Muli evi njinasonekela yeni, vusunga vua Njambi kunjesi nakukuisa.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ambahoni njayile ku mitambela ya ku Siliya na Silisha. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Vuno honi hanga vene kuvanjizivukile ku vikungulukilo via Kilistu via mu Yundeya, <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />vovuile lika nguavo, “Uje uatuyandesele vuno honi alinakuambulula lutsilielo luje luatondele kunongesa.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Kaha vahanene vumpau kuli Njambi muomu yange.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Paulu na tunganda vakuavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Ambahoni hanima ya miaka likumi na iuana njayile naua ku Yelusalema na Mbanambase hamolika na Tito. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Njayile kuje muomu ya kusholola, kaha njaliuanene navo vaje vantuama vuno honi capuile mu vushueke kaha njavahanene Muzimbu Uacili uje unjikambulula hakati ka vaje keti Vayunda, njatondele kuzivuka muacili nguange kunjishatukila cipue njashatukilile viangoco. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Vuno honi Tito uje uakele nange kuva musindiyiye linga alovoke, cipue vene ikeye uapuile Kangelengu. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Vuno honi muomu ya vaka kutsiliela va makuli vaje vezile mu vushueke, vaje vezile mukuseveleka linga vakuende vungungu ha kupatuka cetu kuje tulinaco muli Kilistu Yesu, linga vatupuise vandungo. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Kutualihanene kuli vakevo cipue muka ntsimbu lika, tualingile eci linga vusunga vua Muzimbu Uacili vavutulikile yeni.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Kuli vaje vavakele nakuhana kasingimiko ngue cuma cije caseho, vuno honi muoshe muje muvafuile, kuvalumbunukile cipue cimo kuli yange, Njambi kakele na civembulu, vaje vanjihandeka nguange vantu vavulemu kuvahakeleko cimo kuli yange. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Vuno honi mu ngila ikuavo naua omo vamuene nguavo njakakateya kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili kuli vaje vakuhona kulovoka, ngue Petulu muje muakakateyele kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili kuli vaje kulovoka, <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />muomu Njambi uje uakele nakupangesa Petulu ha vipangi via vaka kulovoka uapangesele nange naua kuli vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yakomba, na Kayafase, na Yiuano vakevo vantuama vaje vavakele nakuhana kasingimiko, omo vanongonuene kavumbi kaje kavanjihanene kuli Njambi, kaha vakuatele mu livoko liange na Mbanambase mukumuesa ngeci tuva voshe tupangele hamo, linga yetu tuye kuli vaje keti Vayunda kaha vakevo vaye kuli vaje vaka kulovoka. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Voshe valombe yetu linga tuvuluke vihutu, eci cikeco cuma cije cinjikatondo kulinga.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu atenukila Petulu ku Antioke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Vuno honi omo Kayafase uezile ku Antioke njamusembuluile ku mesho endi muomu ikeye uapihisile. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Muomu tele kanda vamala vamo veje kuli Yakomba, ikeye ualile na vaje keti Vayunda, Vuno honi omo vezile uavashondolokele nakulihumisako ikeye vavenia mukuteua kulovoka. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Kaha ikeye na vakuavo voshe Vayunda vaputukile kulinga civembulu linga vene cipue Mbanambase na ikeye vamutanguile ku civembulu cavo. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Vuno honi omo njamuene nguange kuvesi nakulinga viakusungama ha vusunga vua Muzimbu Uacili, kaha njahandekele na Kayafase ku mesho avo voshe nguange, “Nkuma nga yove, cili vene u Kayunda vuno honi uyoya ngue uje keti Kayunda, kaha uasa vati kulinga vaje keti Vayunda linga vayoye ngue Vayunda?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayunda na vaje keti vayunda vanovoka ha lutsilielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Yetu vavenia vaje Vayunda ku cisemua kaha keti vaje keti Vayunda vaka vipi, <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />tuzivuka nguetu muntu kasa kupua uakusungama ha vipangi lika via lishiko vuno honi kuhitila mu lutsilielo muli Yesu Kilistu, cipue yetu tunatsiliela muli Kilistu Yesu linga tupue vakusungama ha lutsilielo muli Kilistu, keti ku vipangi via lishiko muomu ha vipangi lika via lishiko naumo uahi akapuilaho uakusungama. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Vuno honi nga mukutonda cetu linga tupue va vusunga muli Kilistu, kaha yetu vavenia tualiuanene kupua vaka vipi, kaha nkuma Kilistu ikeye liavenia vupi ndi? Cilivene houe! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Vuno honi nga naua njitunga viuma vije vinjalundumuine, kaha njalimono yange vavenia nguange muka kupihisa. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Muomu yange kuhitila mu lishiko njatsile ku lishiko, linga njikayoye kuli Njambi. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Vanjishukikile hamo na Kilistu, kaha keti yange naua uje ayoya vuno honi Kilistu ikeye uje ayoya muli yange, kaha na muono uje honi njiyoya mu ntsitu njiyoyela ha lutsilielo muli Muna Njambi, uje uanjizangele nakulihana ikeye vavenia hali yange. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Kunjasa kuteua kavumbi ka Njambi, muomu nga vusunga vavuuana kuhitila mu lishiko, kaha Kilistu viahi viatsililile.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Lishiko cipue lutsilielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Yeni vaka Ngalatiya vakuhona! Nkuma iya namilouo? ku mesho aveya Yesu Kilistu vamuhanene ku vivunga nakumushukika! <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Vandameneni njimihule eci. Nkuma yeni muatambuile Cimbembesi ha vipangi via lishiko indi mukuvuilila na lutsilielo ndi? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Nkuma muvilema vati yeni? Muaputukile na Cimbembesi, nkuma mumanusula honi na ntsitu ndi? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Nkuma muahitila vene mu viuma viavingi muangoco ndi? Cilivene nga vinayi muangoco. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Nkuma uje akamihana Cimbembesi nakupanga vikomoueso hakati keni akavipanga na vipangi via lishiko indi ha viakuvuilila na lutsilielo?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Mukemo vene Avilahama “uatsilielele Njambi, kaha vamutandeleleko kupua uavusunga.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Ivuisiseni ngeci omu mukemo vene mucinafu yeni vamala va lutsilielo vaje vakevo vana va Avilahama. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Kaha navisoneka hakumona vije vilikulutue ngeci Njambi akalinga vaje keti Vayunda kupua vaka vusunga ha lutsilielo, nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili mukulivanga kuli Avilahama nguendi, “Muli yove mafuti vioshe akavikuisula.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Nankuma, vaje vantu voshe vali na lutsilielo vanavakuisula hamo na Avilahama uje uakele na lutsilielo.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Voshe vaje vajendamena ha vipangi via lishiko vanavasingi, muomu vavisoneka nguavo, “Uakusingiua uoshe uje kaniungu viuma vioshe vije vivanasoneka mu livulu lia lishiko nakuvilinga.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Honi calumbunuka muacili ngeci naumo uahi muntu ivapuisa uavusunga kuli Njambi ha lishiko, muomu “Uoshe uje alinga vusunga kuhitila mu lutsilielo akayoya.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Vuno honi lishiko kuliakundamene ha lutsilielo, muomu “Uoshe uje alinga muayilamo lishiko akayoya.” <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kilistu uatupatuile yetu ku cisingo ca lishiko, hakupua ikeye cisingo muomu yetu omo vacisoneka nguavo, “Uakusinga uje ivanashukika ha muti,” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />linga muli Kilistu Yesu ngeci vije vikuisulo via Avilahama vije kuli vaje keti Vayunda, kaha linga tutambule cikulaheso ca Cimbembesi kuhitila mu lutsilielo.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishiko na cikulaheso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Vamuanetu njihana cimueso ca litangua lioshe mu muono uetu, naumo uahi asa kuhumisa ku litavasano lia muntu cipue kuvuezelelako, hanima ya kulikuta. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Honi vikulaheso vivapangelele Avilahama na mutekuluila uendi. Visoneka kuvihandeka nguavio, “Nakuli vatekuluila,” kulumbununa vavengi, vuno honi kulumbununa umo lika, “Nakuli mutekuluila uove,” ikeye Kilistu. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Evi vikevio vinjili nakulumbununa: lishiko lije liezile ha miaka vihita viuana na makumi atatu (430) yakunima, kuliayenguile litavasano lia laja lije Njambi ualingile, nakuhumisa cikulaheso cendi. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Muomu nga kusuana cakundama ha lishiko, kaha kucesi naua ha cikulaheso, vuno honi Njambi uacihanene kuli Avilahama ha cikulaheso.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Nkuma omo vikahoni lishiko? Valihakeleko muomu ya vupi, kuvanga noho hakezila uje mutekuluila uje ivalingilile cije cikulaheso. Lishiko valihanene kuhitila muli tungelo nakulikundika kuli muka kuimanena mukati. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Honi muka kuimanena mukati emanena vavengi, vuno honi Njambi uapua umo lika.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua lishiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Nkuma lishiko lilinakuluisa vikulaheso via Njambi ndi? Cilivene houe, muomu nga lishiko valihanene nguavo liyoyese, kaha cilivene vusunga ngue vuneja muomu ya lishiko. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Vuno honi visoneka vinahaka viuma vioshe ku vupi, linga vioshe vije vivakulahesele ku lutsilielo muli Yesu Kilistu vakavihane kuli vaje vatsiliela.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Honi tele kanda lutsilielo luije, vatukutile ku Lishiko nakutupuisa vinzinda noho vakasholola lutsilielo. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Kaha na Lishiko liakele nakutuendesa kuvanga noho hezilile Kilistu, linga vatupuise vaka vusunga kuhitila mu lutsilielo. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Vuno honi ntsimbu ya lutsilielo ineja, kaha honi kutuapuile naua vinzinda va lishiko.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Muomu muli Kilistu Yesu muva voshe munapu vana va Njambi kuhitila mu lutsilielo. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Muomu vuingi vueni vaje vavambuitikile muli Kilistu munazala Kilistu. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Kukuesi honi Kayunda cipue Kangelengu, kukuesi ndungo cipue uakupatuka, kukuesi yala cipue mpuevo, muomu muva voshe munapu umo muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Kaha nga munapu muvaka Kilistu, kaha muvatekuluila va Avilahama, kaha muva kakusuana kuya ku cikulaheso.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Njilina kulumbununa nguange uje muka kusuana nga acili muanike kaha akapua ngue ndungo cipue nguavo ikeye vene vavenia viuma vioshe. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Vuno honi akakala mu mavoko avakakumuniunga na vaje vavanatsiliela kuvanga noho ha litangua lije liatumbuile ishe. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Kaha netu vene omo tele tuvanike tuapuile tu vandungo va vimbembesi vije vikendesa mavu. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Vuno honi omo ntsimbu yahetele, Njambi uatumine Munendi uje uasemukile ku mpuevo, uakusemukila mu Lishiko, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />mukupatula vaje vakele nakukava lishiko linga vatupuise vana va Njambi. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Muomu munapu mu vana, Njambi natumu Cimbembesi ua Munendi mu mitima yetu, uje akatambeka nguendi, “Tate! Tatetu!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Nankuma, kuhitila muli Njambi kuuapuile naua ndungo vuno honi muana, kaha nga unapu u muana kaha yove muka kusuana.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulishoshomuena ca Paulu hali vaka Ngalatiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Ku laja, omo tele kanda muzivuke Njambi, muakele mu vundungo kuli vaje ku vuntu keti vanjambi. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Vuno honi muomu muazivuka Njambi, cipue muomu honi Njambi namizivuka, nkuma vati naua muhilukila kuli vije vimbembesi via kuzeya viangoco, nkuma mutonda naua linga mupue vandungo vavio ndi? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Yeni mukaniungu matangua, na vingonde, na vintsimbu na miaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Njilina kulishoshomuena nguange hamo nzili yange hali yeni inai muangoco.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Vamuanetu njilinakumilambelela linga mupue ngue yange, muomu nange naua njinapu ngue yeni. Kumuanjilingile cipue vupi vumo. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Muazivuka ngueni muomu ya kuvavala mukemo njambuluile Muzimbu Uacili kuli yeni ha kulivanga. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Kaha cipue vene cihindu cange capuile vieseko kuli yeni, kumuanjiyenguile cipue kunjisembulula, vuno honi muanjitambuile ngue kangelo ua Njambi, cipue ngue Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Nkuma vikahoni vije muavuahelelele cikuma? Muomu njinapu mukaleho nguange nga casiuile ngue muahumisile mesho eni naku ahana kuli yange. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Nkuma honi njinapu citozi ceni muomu yakumileka vusunga ndi?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Ovo vantu vamuesa cizango hali yeni vuno honi visinganieka viavo kuviapuile viacili, vatonda linga vamitepese kuli yetu ngeci muzange vakevo. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Cinapu cuma cacili nga vamikokela ku viuma viacili, kaha cinapu cuma cacili kucilinga ntsimbu yoshe, kaha keti lika nga omo tulihamo. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Vana vange vacizango, vaje hanga naua mucili mu mushongo ngue uje mpuevo atonda kusema kuvanga noho muatambula Kilistu muli yeni. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Njitonda ngue njikale neni hano linga njitengulule lizi liange muomu njalishoshomuena hali yeni.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cimueso ca Hangale na Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Njilekeni, yeni vaje vatonda kukava Lishiko, nkuma kumuekulivua lishiko ndi? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Muomu vanacisoneka nguavo Avilahama uakele na vana vavali va vamala, umo uakuli mpuevo ua ndungo kaha mukuavo uakuli mpuevo uakupatuka. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Vuno honi muana uje uakuli mpuevo ndungo uasemukile kuya ku vuntu, kaha muana uje uakuli mpuevo uakupatuka uasemukile kuya ku cikulaheso. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Honi eci cinapu ngue cisimo, ava vampuevo vanapu matavasano avali. Umo ahuminina ku Munkinda ua Sinai, kusemena vana mu vundungo, ou ikeye Hangale. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Honi Hangale ikeye Munkinda ua Sinai mu Alambiya, ikeye nemanena Yelusalema ije iliko, muomu ikeye ali mu vundungo na vana vendi. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Vuno honi Yelusalema ije ili muilu ikeyo yakupatuka, kaha ikeye nanetu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Muomu vanacisoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Vuaheleleni, yeni vantsimpi vaje kuvekusema!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Lileni nakutambeka na nzolela, yeni vaje kumuesi mu mushongo uakusema!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Muomu vana va uje ivasezele vanapu vavengi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">kupulakana vana vendi uje nashomboka.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Honi yetu, vamuanetu, ngue Isake, yetu tu vana vacikulaheso. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Vuno honi ngue kuntsimbu ije uje muana uasemukile kuya ku vuntu uapakesele uje uasemukile kuya ku cimbembesi, kaha omu mukemo mucilimo cipue hano. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Vuno honi visoneka nkuma vihandeka vika? Vihandeka nguavio, “Sheka mpuevo ua ndungo na munendi, muomu muana uje ua ndungo kasa kukasuana hamo na muana ua uje mpuevo uakupatuka.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Nankuma, vamuanetu, yetu keti tu vana va uje ndungo vuno honi va uje mpuevo uakupatuka.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Niungeni kupatuka ceni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Muomu ya kupatuka mukemo Kilistu natupatula, nankuma, imaneni ngoo kaha keti mulihane naua ku mutiyo ua vundungo.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Ivuilileni yange Paulu, njihandeka kuli yeni nguange nga mutambula kulovoka, kaha Kilistu kakakala na seho kuli yeni. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Njihilukilaho naua kunangula ku yala uoshe uje akatambula kulovoka nguange, ikeye vanamukutu mukutulika lishiko lioshe. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Vanamihumisa kuli Kilistu yeni voshe vaje vavapuisa va vusunga ku lishiko, munahumu ku kavumbi. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Muomu kuhitila muli Cimbembesi, tulina kuvandamena kutsiliela ca vusunga kuhitila mu lutsilielo. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Muomu muli Kilistu Yesu kukuesi kulovoka cipue kuhona kulovoka cije cili naseho, vuno honi lutsilielo lupanga kuhitila mu cizango.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Muakele nakulinga muacili, nkuma iya honi uamivindikile kuononoka vusunga? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Kusindiya eci kucahumine kuli uje uamisanene. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Kacimbaluila kakandende kakafutunuisa mukasha uoshe. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Njatsiliela muli Muene nguange kumukatambula cuma ceka kupulakana cange, kaha na uje uoshe alinakumiyandesa akauana cisompelo cendi.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Vamuanetu vuno honi nga yange hanga njicili nakuambulula kulovoka, nkuma vikahoni hanga vacinjipakesa? Ha mulonga ou kaha cije citsuntsuiso ca cilindakano vanacihumisa. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Njitonda linga vaje vantu vaje valina kumitanganesa keti valengesele aha lika, veceleni vatualeleleho nakulipuisa vayunuke.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Vamuanetu, yeni vamisanene ngeci mupatuke, kaha honi keti mupangese kupatuka ceni cipue lisesa lia ku muvila ueni ua ntsitu, vuno honi pueni vangamba kuli umo na mukuavo kuhitila mu cizango. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Muomu Lishiko lioshe vanalishulisisa mu lizi limo lika lije lihandeka ngualio, “Zanga mukueni ngue muje lizanga yove vavenia.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Vuno honi nga munapu ngue tusitu va mu musenge vaje valishuma nakulivulumuna umo na mukuavo kaha nangukeni linga keti mukalinongese umo na mukuavo.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cimbembesi na cisemua ca vuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Vuno honi njihandeka nguange endeni mu Cimbembesi kaha keti muvuahelese mashungu aku muvila ua ntsitu. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Muomu mashungu aku muvila ua ntsitu akaluisa Cimbembesi, kaha na mashungu a Cimbembesi akaluisa muvila ua ntsitu, muomu evi kuvia litombuele, kaha vikamikingi ku kulinga vije vimutonda kulinga. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Vuno honi nga mutava Cimbembesi kumituamenena kaha Lishiko kuliesi na nzili hali yeni.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Honi vipangi via muvila ua ntsitu viapua viangoco: vikevio viapua vupangala, kulijualesa, vilinga via kuteuesa, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kulemesa tumponia, vulozi, vutozi, vaka kulua, cipululu, vutenu, vaka kulizanga vavenia, vaka kulitepesa ku vakuavo, vaka cimbembesi ca kuzanga viuano, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />vaka lifuua, vaka kupenda, nakulinga viuma vieka ngue evi. Njiminangula ngue muje naua munjaminanguile ha kulivanga, ngeci vaje voshe vakalingi viuma evi kuvakasuana Vumuene vua Njambi.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Vuno honi vushuka vua Cimbembesi vuapua cizango, nzolela, ciyulo, lukakateya, ngozi, vucili, kulongua, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />kulikehesa na kulihilula, kaha kukuesi lishiko liluisa viuma evi. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Kaha vaje voshe vakundama kuli Kilistu Yesu vanashukika muvila ua ntsitu na vilinga viauo na mashungu auo. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Nga tuyoyela hali Cimbembesi, kaha tuyeni tutavese Cimbembesi linga atutuamenene. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Kutuapandele kupua vaka kulihalesa cipue kuliputuka umo na mukuavo, cipue kulivuila cipululu umo na mukuavo.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Liambateseni viteli via umo na mukuavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Vamuanetu, nga muntu umo vanamuuana na mulonga uoshe, kaha yeni vaje vanatambula cimbembesi munapande kumusungamesa mu kulikehesa. Kaha lihiluleni yeni vavenia kuteua mukakovele naua mu ceseko eci. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Liambateseni viteli via umo na mukuavo, kaha mukulinga eci mukashulisisa lishiko lia Kilistu. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Muomu nga uoshe uje asinganieka nguendi napu uakama, vuno honi keti mukemo muanapu, kaha ali nakulikuisa ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Vuno honi muntu na muntu ahilule vipangi viendi vavenia, kaha kuya ku vipangi viendi akasa kulihalesa ikeye vavenia keti hali mukuavo. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Muomu muntu na muntu akaliambatela citeli cendi vavenia.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Muntu uoshe uje ivanalongesa lizi akalipangela viuma vioshe viacili na uje namulongesavio.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Keti vamikuise, Njambi kuveku mushendumuna, muomu vioshe vije viakuna muntu, vikevio naua viakateja. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Muomu uoshe uje akuva ku muvila uendi, kaha ku muvila uendi naua kukeko kuakateja kunonga. Vuno honi uoshe uje akuva ku Cimbembesi, kaha ku Cimbembesi naua kukeko kuakateja muono uayaye. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Keti tuhone mukulinga viuma viacili, muomu ntsimbu ikeja ije tukateja muacili nga tutualelelaho nalukakateya. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Nankuma, muomu tucilina ntsimbu, tuyeni tulinge vucili ku vantu voshe, kaha cikuma kumani ku ntanga ije ya lutsilielo.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunangula cakumanusuila na cihindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Taleni kuhama ca visona vije njili nakumisonekela na livoko liange! <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Vaje vakatondo kuvuahelesa vantu ku ntsitu vakevo vaje vakamisindiya linga mulovoke. Eci vakacilingila lika linga vateue kuvapakesa muomu ya cilindakano ca Kilistu. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Muomu cipue vene vaje vanalovoka kuvekutulika lishiko, vuno honi vakashunguiya yeni linga mulovoke ngeci vauane vumpau mu muvila ueni. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Vuno honi yange kunjikalihalesa hali evi, kuvanga lika ha cilindakano ca Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, uje muli ikeye mavu vana ashukika kuli yange, nange vananjishukika ku mavu. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Muomu kukuesi mulonga cipue ualovoka indi ku ualovokele, vuno honi cakama kupua uakutanga lualuha. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Ciyulo na cikeketima vikale kuli yeni voshe vaje venda na lishiko eli, na kuli Isaleli ya Njambi.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Kuhuma hano, keti kukale muntu umo anjihane vukalu, muomu njinambata vitamba via Yesu ha muvila uange.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Kavumbi ka Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu kakale na cimbembesi ceni, vamuanetu. Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>